                                                "text": "\"And now, my dearest Lucy, collect yourself, for all depends upon our own resources.\" Such were the whispered exclamations with which Francesca cheered her trembling companion, whose courage was not heightened by the darkness and stillness around them as they proceeded on their hazardous enterprise."
